code: 0
--- stdout
Work is stuck: waiting for another issue or an outside decision

  From:      In progress
  To:        Waiting; an issue already there keeps it, so a repeat is safe
  Requires:  at least one of --by, --comment
  Board:     adds the issue if it is not there
  Blockers:  --by naming an issue (12, #12, owner/repo#12) also marks this one blocked by it
  Comment:   posted unless it renders empty or is already the latest gh-dojo comment:
               Waiting for {by}.

               {comment}

Usage:
  gh dojo wait <N> [flags]

Flags:
      --by string        value for {by} in the comment: an issue (12, #12 or owner/repo#12), also marked as blocking this one, or free text
      --comment string   text for {comment} in the comment
      --dry-run          print the plan without changing anything
  -h, --help             help for wait
--- stderr
